    "id": 581709,
    "title": "IEEE Day 2026 – IEEE Day Announcement",
    "description": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">IEEE Day 2026 - Announcement</span></strong></h1>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IEEE Day 2026 is an opportunity for the IEEE Student Branch at Philadelphia University to celebrate the IEEE community and highlight the values of collaboration, innovation, knowledge sharing, leadership, and technological development.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The activity aims to raise awareness of IEEE and its role in supporting students in their academic, technical, and professional journeys. It will highlight the opportunities available through IEEE and encourage students to become more engaged with the IEEE Student Branch, its activities, and its community.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Through this celebration, the IEEE Student Branch at Philadelphia University seeks to strengthen connections among students, IEEE members, volunteers, and technology enthusiasts within the university. The activity will encourage interaction, idea sharing, teamwork, creativity, and continuous learning, while highlighting the importance of technology and engineering in shaping the future.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1462\">&nbsp;</p>",
