    "title": "IEEE Student Branch Inauguration Ceremony",
    "description": "<p>he IEEE Student Branch Inauguration Ceremony at Ajloun University College &ndash; Balqa Applied University marks the official launch of the IEEE Student Branch. The event brings together students, faculty members, university representatives, and invited guests to celebrate the establishment of the branch and introduce its vision, objectives, and upcoming activities. The ceremony aims to promote innovation, technical knowledge, professional development, leadership, and active student engagement through IEEE.</p>",
